Test-only backport of the libcontainer test hunk of runc commit
3e92f3f539d66a4a80a676811a6d794e4898a785 (cherry-picked to release-1.5 as
c288f83b, "build(deps): bump github.com/opencontainers/cgroups from 0.0.6 to
0.0.8", lifubang):

    Adapt to the updated `cgroups.Manager` interface:
    // Stats returns statistics for specified controllers.
    Stats(opts *StatsOptions) (*Stats, error)

runc-1.4 bumps opencontainers/cgroups to v0.1.0, the oldest cgroups release
that builds against github.com/cilium/ebpf v0.22.0 (CVE-2026-10722):
cgroups v0.0.6 through v0.0.9 still call ebpf ProgramInfo.RunCount/Runtime,
which ebpf removed in v0.19.0. The bumped interface gained Stats(), so the test
mock no longer compiled. runc's production code doesn't implement
cgroups.Manager and builds unchanged.

diff --git a/libcontainer/container_linux_test.go b/libcontainer/container_linux_test.go
index 0d0dc44..cce320e 100644
--- a/libcontainer/container_linux_test.go
+++ b/libcontainer/container_linux_test.go
@@ -28,6 +28,10 @@ func (m *mockCgroupManager) GetStats() (*cgroups.Stats, error) {
 	return nil, nil
 }
 
+func (m *mockCgroupManager) Stats(_ *cgroups.StatsOptions) (*cgroups.Stats, error) {
+	return nil, nil
+}
+
 func (m *mockCgroupManager) Apply(pid int) error {
 	return nil
 }
